    "body": "## M82 only\n\n- Reuses M81 eligibility from `stage715FirstIndependentBattleComplete`.\n- Reveals the existing Events UI entry/control after the first independent qualifying WIN through the normal render lifecycle, without reload or a second persisted truth.\n- Preserves tutorial, Oleg, battle, Events, economy/REP/money/wins, persistence, telemetry, and ordinary behavior.\n- Adds no canonical narrative, participants, side choices, choices/actions, announcement copy, reward/refund, REP/money/wins effects, friendship, resolution, completion, or persistence behavior for M83-M85.\n\nFocused deterministic proof covers PREQUALIFYING_LOCK, START_ONLY_LOCK, LOSS_LOCK, INTERRUPTED_LOCK, UNRELATED_BATTLE_LOCK, QUALIFYING_WIN_VISIBLE, CONTROL_INTERACTIVE, NO_M83_CONTENT, IDEMPOTENCY, and M81/Events/tutorial regression.",
    "changed_files": 6,
